</b></p><p style=\"opacity:.75;margin:0;\">the cheapest of the three</p></div>","recordPrompt":"Listen, then say it!","expectedText":"Le moins cher des trois","size":null,"created":{"_seconds":1793276054,"_nanoseconds":793000000}},{"id":"SpKoyXjRXPcYNJ52k4e0","level":"a2","lesson":16,"part":6,"type":"text","name":"a2-l16-p06-b1","partTitle":"Say it 4/4","transitionMode":"button","url":null,"imageUrl":null,"content":"<div style=\"text-align:center;\"><p style=\"font-size:1.7rem;margin:6px 0;\"><b>La plus belle ville du pays</b></p><p style=\"opacity:.75;margin:0;\">the most beautiful city in the country</p></div>","recordPrompt":"Listen, then say it!","expectedText":"La plus belle ville du pays","size":null,"created":{"_seconds":1793276055,"_nanoseconds":248000000}},{"id":"ryr7pLdJ0rP5wBhEgbl9","level":"a2","lesson":16,"part":7,"type":"text","name":"a2-l16-p07-b1","partTitle":"Listen to the conversation","transitionMode":"button","url":null,"imageUrl":null,"content":"<p style=\"opacity:.8;\">Read and listen to the whole conversation first. You play the “You” part next.</p><p style=\"margin:8px 0;\"><span style=\"opacity:.7;font-size:.8rem;\">🧑‍🏫</span><br><b>Vous cherchez un hôtel. Lequel est le plus confortable ?</b><br><span style=\"opacity:.7;font-size:.9rem;\">You're looking for a hotel. Which is the most comfortable?</span></p><p style=\"margin:8px 0;text-align:right;\"><span style=\"opacity:.7;font-size:.8rem;\">You</span><br><b>L'hôtel Soleil est le plus confortable.</b><br><span style=\"opacity:.7;font-size:.9rem;\">Hotel Soleil is the most comfortable.</span></p><p style=\"margin:8px 0;\"><span style=\"opacity:.7;font-size:.8rem;\">🧑‍🏫</span><br><b>Et le moins cher ?</b><br><span style=\"opacity:.7;font-size:.9rem;\">And the cheapest?</span></p><p style=\"margin:8px 0;text-align:right;\"><span style=\"opacity:.7;font-size:.8rem;\">You</span><br><b>L'hôtel Palmier est le moins cher.</b><br><span style=\"opacity:.7;font-size:.9rem;\">Hotel Palmier is the cheapest.</span></p><p style=\"margin:8px 0;\"><span style=\"opacity:.7;font-size:.8rem;\">🧑‍🏫</span><br><b>Et le mieux situé ?</b><br><span style=\"opacity:.7;font-size:.9rem;\">And the best located?</span></p><p style=\"margin:8px 0;text-align:right;\"><span style=\"opacity:.7;font-size:.8rem;\">You</span><br><b>C'est l'hôtel Soleil aussi. Il est près de la plage.</b><br><span style=\"opacity:.7;font-size:.9rem;\">It's Hotel Soleil too. It's near the beach.</span></p><p style=\"margin:8px 0;\"><span style=\"opacity:.7;font-size:.8rem;\">🧑‍🏫</span><br><b>Alors, lequel vous choisissez ?</b><br><span style=\"opacity:.7;font-size:.9rem;\">So, which do you choose?</span></p><p style=\"margin:8px 0;text-align:right;\"><span style=\"opacity:.7;font-size:.8rem;\">You</span><br><b>Je choisis l'hôtel Soleil, c'est le meilleur choix.</b><br><span style=\"opacity:.7;font-size:.9rem;\">I choose Hotel Soleil, it's the best choice.</span></p>","recordPrompt":null,"expectedText":null,"size":null,"created":{"_seconds":1793276055,"_nanoseconds":255000000}},{"id":"xAtxqfhi7M3XOMauARpJ","level":"a2","lesson":16,"part":8,"type":"text","name":"a2-l16-p08-b1","partTitle":"Your turn 1/4","transitionMode":"button","url":null,"imageUrl":null,"content":"<p style=\"margin:6px 0;\">🧑‍🏫 <b>Vous cherchez un hôtel. Lequel est le plus confortable ?</b><br><span style=\"opacity:.7;font-size:.9rem;\">You're looking for a hotel. Which is the most comfortable?</span></p><p style=\"margin:12px 0 0;text-align:right;\"><span style=\"opacity:.7;font-size:.8rem;\">You</span><br><b style=\"font-size:1.3rem;\">L'hôtel Soleil est le plus confortable.</b><br><span style=\"opacity:.7;font-size:.9rem;\">Hotel Soleil is the most comfortable.</span></p>","recordPrompt":"Your turn! Say your line.","expectedText":"L'hôtel Soleil est le plus confortable.","size":null,"created":{"_seconds":1793276055,"_nanoseconds":258000000}},{"id":"wFkroV4drkpyngg8m5G1","level":"a2","lesson":16,"part":9,"type":"text","name":"a2-l16-p09-b1","partTitle":"Your turn 2/4","transitionMode":"button","url":null,"imageUrl":null,"content":"<p style=\"margin:6px 0;\">🧑‍🏫 <b>Et le moins cher ?</b><br><span style=\"opacity:.7;font-size:.9rem;\">And the cheapest?</span></p><p style=\"margin:12px 0 0;text-align:right;\"><span style=\"opacity:.7;font-size:.8rem;\">You</span><br><b style=\"font-size:1.3rem;\">L'hôtel Palmier est le moins cher.</b><br><span style=\"opacity:.7;font-size:.9rem;\">Hotel Palmier is the cheapest.</span></p>","recordPrompt":"Your turn! Say your line.","expectedText":"L'hôtel Palmier est le moins cher.","size":null,"created":{"_seconds":1793276055,"_nanoseconds":410000000}},{"id":"OeYIxN4rIYTGVYjSNAGk","level":"a2","lesson":16,"part":10,"type":"text","name":"a2-l16-p10-b1","partTitle":"Your turn 3/4","transitionMode":"button","url":null,"imageUrl":null,"content":"<p style=\"margin:6px 0;\">🧑‍🏫 <b>Et le mieux situé ?</b><br><span style=\"opacity:.7;font-size:.9rem;\">And the best located?</span></p><p style=\"margin:12px 0 0;text-align:right;\"><span style=\"opacity:.7;font-size:.8rem;\">You</span><br><b style=\"font-size:1.3rem;\">C'est l'hôtel Soleil aussi. Il est près de la plage.</b><br><span style=\"opacity:.7;font-size:.9rem;\">It's Hotel Soleil too. It's near the beach.</span></p>","recordPrompt":"Your turn! Say your line.","expectedText":"C'est l'hôtel Soleil aussi. Il est près de la plage.","size":null,"created":{"_seconds":1793276055,"_nanoseconds":654000000}},{"id":"3g6jxjXOA9pr7s9ZJwwe","level":"a2","lesson":16,"part":11,"type":"text","name":"a2-l16-p11-b1","partTitle":"Your turn 4/4","transitionMode":"button","url":null,"imageUrl":null,"content":"<p style=\"margin:6px 0;\">🧑‍🏫 <b>Alors, lequel vous choisissez ?</b><br><span style=\"opacity:.7;font-size:.9rem;\">So, which do you choose?</span></p><p style=\"margin:12px 0 0;text-align:right;\"><span style=\"opacity:.7;font-size:.8rem;\">You</span><br><b style=\"font-size:1.3rem;\">Je choisis l'hôtel Soleil, c'est le meilleur choix.</b><br><span style=\"opacity:.7;font-size:.9rem;\">I choose Hotel Soleil, it's the best choice.</span></p>","recordPrompt":"Your turn! Say your line.","expectedText":"Je choisis l'hôtel Soleil, c'est le meilleur choix.","size":null,"created":{"_seconds":1793276055,"_nanoseconds":660000000}},{"id":"rBNAtMay0qIs8kuC3eZP","level":"a2","lesson":16,"part":12,"type":"text","name":"a2-l16-p12-b1","partTitle":"Speak freely","transitionMode":"button","url":null,"imageUrl":null,"content":"<div style=\"text-align:center;\"><p style=\"font-size:1.4rem;margin:6px 0;\"><b>Recommandez un lieu dans votre ville.</b></p><p style=\"opacity:.75;margin:0 0 10px;\">Recommend a place in your town.</p><p><b>Recommend the best place and explain why with a superlative.</b></p><p style=\"opacity:.7;\">For example: “C'est le meilleur restaurant de la ville. C'est le plus calme et le moins cher.”</p></div>","recordPrompt":"Now it's your turn to speak!","expectedText":"C'est le meilleur restaurant de la ville. C'est le plus calme et le moins cher.","size":null,"created":{"_seconds":1793276055,"_nanoseconds":657000000}},{"id":"Pkq6rZTLilbXzLVweRKL","level":"a2","lesson":16,"part":13,"type":"text","name":"a2-l16-p13-b1","partTitle":"Well done","transitionMode":"button","url":null,"imageUrl":null,"content":"<div style=\"text-align:center;\"><div style=\"font-size:64px;line-height:1.1;\">⭐</div><p><b>Superlative star!</b></p></div><p style=\"line-height:1.6;\">🧑‍🏫 You can use superlatives to recommend and choose. Excellent for conversations about travel.</p>","recordPrompt":null,"expectedText":null,"size":null,"created":{"_seconds":1793276055,"_nanoseconds":818000000}}]